      "note": "To say that you want to do something, use **feel like** and an **-ing** form."
    },
    {
      "incorrect": "I have a good feeling with this plan.",
      "correct": "I have a good feeling about this plan.",
      "note": "Use **about** after *a good feeling* or *a bad feeling*."
    }
